{
 "sheet": 1,
 "name": "FOJAN-frc",
 "kind": "resistor",
 "manufacturer": "FOJAN",
 "title": "FRC series general-purpose thick film chip resistors, 01005 to 2512",
 "source": {
  "document": "FJ-JS-3001",
  "revision": "V3.0, 2026.04.25",
  "pages": 14
 },
 "summary": "A family of thick film chip resistors on an alumina substrate with a ruthenium oxide resistive film, nickel barrier and tin-plated terminations, in ten sizes from 01005 to 2512. Values run from 1 Ω to 10 MΩ in tolerances from ±0.05% to ±5%, plus zero-ohm jumpers. Rated power at 70 °C goes from 1/32 W (01005) to 1 W (2512), and TCR is ±100 ppm/°C from 10 Ω up in 0402 and larger. The parts are RoHS compliant and halogen free, for home appliance, computer, communications, industrial automation and consumer equipment.",
